 "applies_to": "Panasonic KW7M (AKW7111 / AKW7111B) with Modbus RTU selected, user manual ARCT1F434E-6.",
 "summary": "The KW7M is a small DIN-rail energy meter for single-phase or three-phase three-wire circuits using dedicated or 5 A CTs, with an RS485 port that speaks MEWTOCOL or Modbus RTU. Its Modbus table is short: two phase currents, two line voltages, active power and the metering and alarm settings, all as holding registers.",
